"Yojaka · [READ-ONLY]                                                                                                                               12,871 files "
" ╭───────────╮╭─────────────╮╭────────────────╮╭──────────────╮╭────────────╮╭───────────╮                                                                      "
" │ 1 Actions ││ 2 Dashboard ││ 3 File browser ││ 4 Duplicates ││ 5 Organize ││ 6 History │                                                                      "
"─┘           └┴─────────────┴┴────────────────┴┴──────────────┴┴────────────┴┴───────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"
" Ready-made jobs for /photos. Each one scans the folder, shows what is in it, asks a few questions, then runs with a progress bar. Nothing changes until you    "
" confirm.                                                                                                                                                       "
"                                                                                                                                                                "
" ▶ Organize into folders                                                                                                                                        "
"     Copies or moves every photo and video into new folders: by place, by year, or all in one. Identical files are copied once.                                 "
"     Scan → Summary → Layout → Destination → Confirm → Run                                                                                                      "
"                                                                                                                                                                "
"   Remove duplicates                                                                                                                                            "
"     Finds files with exactly the same bytes and moves the extra copies to the Trash, keeping one of each. Look-alikes are left for the Duplicates tab.         "
"     Scan → Summary → Find identical → Keep which copy → Confirm → Run                                                                                          "
"                                                                                                                                                                "
